    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313-a2">

                <pb facs="0355" n="239" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg239"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Captain Russell, U. S.
                        Navy, to the Secretary of the Navy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Puerto Plata</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-19T21:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 19, 1914, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have not yet received from Borclas or Rubiosa any acknowledgment of my letter
                    forbidding the bombardment of Puerto Plata. Consular Corps in conference to-day
                    unanimously opposed bombardment, * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
